      59.53,
      101.53,
      373.51,
      120.31
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends the First Schedule to the Social Security Contribution Levy Act, No. 25 of 2022, and the legal effect of that schedule as amended is to -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.53,
      130.33,
      373.52,
      149.11
    ],
    "text": "(a) restrict the exemption provided under item 24 of PART IA by setting out a time period applicable to any institution referred to in such item;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.53,
      159.13,
      373.54,
      177.91
    ],
    "text": "(b) make the exemption provided under item 4 of PART IB clearer to include the wholesale and retail sale of such exempted articles;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.53,
      187.93,
      373.54,
      216.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) expand the exemption provided under item 4 of PART II by applying the exemption to services provided in relation to international transportation by container terminal operators; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
